{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense melee and spellcasting combat, near limitless build diversity, and dark mysteries to solve. Forge your path as you explore the Unknown Lands in Cursemark, a fantasy action roguelite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/37b61d6edea979b128ee3cbc853d6ee6.poster.avif?t=1771535770\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/37b61d6edea979b128ee3cbc853d6ee6.webm?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/37b61d6edea979b128ee3cbc853d6ee6.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your build and playstyle with runes that change how every ability works by integrating them into your attacks, spells, wards, and ultimates. Add chain lightning to your sword and burst enemies into poison clouds. Multiply your fireball spell and erupt ice pillars from the ground when you cast it. Blind enemies and heal yourself when they strike your ward. The possibilities feel endless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/6c80dbad39a3f6b3e0cd972d834356eb.poster.avif?t=1771535770\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/6c80dbad39a3f6b3e0cd972d834356eb.webm?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/6c80dbad39a3f6b3e0cd972d834356eb.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unknown Lands are vast, full of secret passages, hidden relics, and strange sights. The world unravels more and more with each run as you make new discoveries and solve riddles to unlock power and shortcuts. No map-markers, no hand-holding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/e205c2e2a309f86f3ecc4b611555ec67.poster.avif?t=1771535770\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/e205c2e2a309f86f3ecc4b611555ec67.webm?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/e205c2e2a309f86f3ecc4b611555ec67.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pathfinding is a part of your build as well. Discover permanent shrines and forges that expand your power and rune slots. Upgrade them for future runs and target the blessings best suited to your build as you grow in skill and knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/7f9acfa315de27e3ff47754f6b9cd279.poster.avif?t=1771535770\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/7f9acfa315de27e3ff47754f6b9cd279.webm?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/7f9acfa315de27e3ff47754f6b9cd279.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219180?t=1771535770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/4b0985d6ef5a3a8c01828b9b93ed914fe96e8b1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771535770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/a17d964d1860b7a6572eef4f9cdf45443542e4b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771535770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/a17d964d1860b7a6572eef4f9cdf45443542e4b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771535770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3853080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense melee and spellcasting combat, near limitless build diversity, and dark mysteries to solve. Forge your path as you explore the Unknown Lands in Cursemark, a fantasy action roguelite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/37b61d6edea979b128ee3cbc853d6ee6.poster.avif?t=1771535770\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/37b61d6edea979b128ee3cbc853d6ee6.webm?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/37b61d6edea979b128ee3cbc853d6ee6.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\