ets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/e205c2e2a309f86f3ecc4b611555ec67.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pathfinding is a part of your build as well. Discover permanent shrines and forges that expand your power and rune slots. Upgrade them for future runs and target the blessings best suited to your build as you grow in skill and knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/7f9acfa315de27e3ff47754f6b9cd279.poster.avif?t=1771535770\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/7f9acfa315de27e3ff47754f6b9cd279.webm?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/7f9acfa315de27e3ff47754f6b9cd279.mp4?t=1771535770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CLYDE games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/1ea8ef162ee8ff8dca849ff84a8c222a0b1efb71/header.jpg?t=1771535770","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7+ GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> glibc version 2.34+ required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"